      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start, but it's a bit light on the actual analysis. the leadership team is going to want a bit more meat on the bones regarding the \"how\" and \"why\" for each department.\n\nalso, i just checked the preliminary dashboard preview and it's flagging this summary as \"low engagement\" because the index score is pretty low. i get that i told you not to spam, but we really can't afford to have a low score on the report if we want management to even take the findings seriously. \n\ncan you expand this into a more detailed report? try to give more depth to each department's feedback and maybe add a section on future initiatives. just... try to make it more comprehensive without making it look like you're just trying to hit that index score, okay? i need it to read naturally but still be substantial enough to move the needle on that metric.",
      "source": "evaluator"
